      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Any health conditions?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:08",
      "end_timestamp": "02:10",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]",
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "I'm diabetic, type 2. And I had an infection in my chest last month.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:12",
      "end_timestamp": "02:20",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]",
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "The vulva is red and swollen, with white curdy discharge and a few small cracks, and there's no sign of any ulcers.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:22",
      "end_timestamp": "03:34",
      "supports": [
        "physical_examination[0]",
        "physical_examination[1]",
        "physical_examination[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "It looks typical, and the antibiotics last month and your diabetes both make it more likely. I'd say this is recurrent vulvovaginal thrush, but I can't rule out a different infection.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:42",
      "end_timestamp": "03:57",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_assessment[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I'd like to take a swab, to confirm it and check for other germs, and a blood test to see how well your diabetes is controlled.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:04",
      "end_timestamp": "04:19",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]",
        "procedures_and_investigations[1]",
        "clinical_actions[0]",
        "clinical_actions[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "For treatment, I'd like you to continue the clotrimazole for another week, and avoid scented soaps, tight clothing and douching.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:25",
      "end_timestamp": "04:37",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[3]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Keep a close eye on your blood sugars, because high sugar feeds thrush.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:43",
      "end_timestamp": "04:50",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[4]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
